    "N$_2$(g) + 3H$_2$(g) $\\rightleftharpoons$ $\\xrightarrow{t^\\circ, p, xt}$ 2NH$_3$(g)        $\\Delta_\\text{r}\\text{H}^\\circ$ = -91,8 kJ",
