  "content": [
    "# Bi 1 LM QUEN VI VT L",
    "",
    "**Khi ng:** Hnh bn l cc nh vt l tiu biu cho mi giai on pht trin khoa hc v cng ngh ca nhn loi. Em  bit g v cc nh khoa hc ny?",
    "[Hnh nh 3 nh khoa hc: Galilei, Newton, Einstein]",
    "Galilei (Ga-li-l) (1564  1642): Cha  ca phng php thc nghim.",
    "Newton (Niu-tn) (1642  1727): Ngi tm ra nh lut vn vt hp dn.",
    "Einstein (Anh-xtanh) (1879  1955): Ngi tm ra thuyt tng i v cng thc: E = mc$^2$.",
    "",
    "## I. I TNG NGHIN CU CA VT L V MC TIU CA MN VT L",
    "",
    "Thut ng vt l c ngun gc t ting Hy Lp physiko c ngha l kin thc v t nhin. Vt l l mn \"khoa hc t nhin\" c i tng nghin cu tp trung vo cc dng vn ng ca vt cht (cht, trng), nng lng.",
    "Cc lnh vc nghin cu ca Vt l rt a dng, t C hc, in hc, in t hc, Quang hc, m hc, Nhit hc, Nhit ng lc hc n Vt l nguyn t v ht nhn, Vt l lng t, Thuyt tng i.",
