    "",
    "## II. QU TRNH PHT TRIN CA VT L",
    "",
    "Di y l s  trnh by cc giai on chnh trong qu trnh pht trin ca Vt l. Mi giai on c mt tnh cht, c im ring.",
    "",
    "Cc nh trit hc tm hiu th gii t nhin da trn quan st v suy lun ch quan.",
    "*T nm 350 trc Cng nguyn n th k XVI (tin Vt l)*",
