    " M hnh vt cht:  l cc vt thu nh hoc phng to ca vt tht, c mt s c im ging vt tht. Qu a cu trong phng th nghim l v d v m hnh vt cht thu nh ca Tri t, h Mt Tri c th coi l m hnh vt cht phng to ca mu nguyn t ca Rutherford.",
    " M hnh l thuyt: Khi nghin cu chuyn ng ca mt  t ang chy trn ng di, ngi ta coi  t l mt \"cht im\", khi nghin cu v nh sng ngi ta dng m hnh tia sng  biu din ng truyn ca nh sng.",
    "Cht im, tia sng nu trn l cc v d v m hnh l thuyt.",
    " M hnh ton hc:  l cc cng thc, phng trnh,  th, k hiu,... ca Ton hc dng  m t cc c im ca cc i tng nghin cu. Vect dng  m t mt i lng c hng, v d lc,  dch chuyn; phng trnh $s = v.t$ l m hnh ton hc ca chuyn ng thng u,...",
    "Tu theo tng loi m hnh c th m c th c cc quy trnh xy dng v s dng m hnh khc nhau. Tuy nhin cc bc sau y c coi l cc bc cn thit cho vic xy dng mi loi m hnh:",
    "1. Xc nh i tng cn c m hnh ho.",
