    "**? Cu hi:**",
    "1. Hy k tn mt s m hnh vt cht m em thy trong phng th nghim.",
    "2. Hy nu tn mt m hnh l thuyt m em  hc.",
    "3. Cc m hnh ton hc v  Hnh 1.9 dng  m t loi chuyn ng no?",
    "[Hnh 1.9 a)  th s-t; b)  th v-t]",
    "",
    "[S  ca phng php m hnh: 1. Xc nh i tng cn m hnh ho -> 2. Xy dng m hnh (gi thuyt) -> 3. Kim tra s ph hp ca m hnh -> 4. Kt lun / iu chnh m hnh nu cn]",
    "*Hnh 1.10. S  ca phng php m hnh*",
    "",
    "**EM  HC**",
    "- i tng nghin cu ch yu ca Vt l l cc dng ca vt cht, nng lng.",
    "- Phng php nghin cu thng s dng ca Vt l l phng php thc nghim v phng php m hnh.",
    "- Vt l c coi l c s ca KHTN v cng ngh.",
    "",
    "**EM C TH**",
    "D on v s ph thuc tc  bay hi ca nc vo nhit  nc v gi thi trn mt nc, ri lp phng n th nghim  kim tra d on.",
    "",
    "11"
  ]
}
$JSON$) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

INSERT INTO lessons (chapter_id, code, name, page, sort_order, knowledge_json) VALUES
((SELECT id FROM chapters WHERE code = 'CH1' AND textbook_id = (SELECT id FROM textbooks WHERE code = 'LI10')), 'B2', 'Bài 2. Các quy tắc an toàn trong phòng thực hành vật lí', 13, 3, $JSON$
{
  "content": [
    "# Bi 2 CC QUY TC AN TON TRONG PHNG THC HNH VT L",
    "",
    "**Khi ng:** Khi lm th nghim cn m bo ngi lm th nghim khng gp nguy him,  dng, thit b khng b h hng, chy n. Lm th no  m bo an ton trong khi tin hnh th nghim?",
    "",
    "## I. AN TON KHI S DNG THIT B TH NGHIM",
    "**1. S dng cc thit b in**",
    "Trong s cc th nghim vt l ph thng th cc thit b s dng in c nguy c mt an ton cao nht. Cn quan st k cc k hiu v nhn thng s trn thit b  s dng ng chc nng, ng yu cu k thut.",
    "",
    "[Hnh 2.1a: My bin p (my bin th) vi cc cng AC, DC]",
    "[Hnh 2.1b: B chuyn i in p vi cc thng s input, output]",
    "*Hnh 2.1. Hai loi thit b cung cp ngun in*",
    "",
    "**Hot ng:** Hy quan st hai thit b chuyn i in p, tham kho k hiu  Bng 2.1 v tho lun  tr li cc cu hi sau:",
    "1. Chc nng ca hai thit b l g? Ging v khc nhau nh th no?",
    "2. B chuyn i in p (Hnh 2.1b) s dng hiu in th vo bao nhiu?",
    "3. Cc hiu in th u ra nh th no?",
    "4. Nhng nguy c no c th gy mt an ton hoc hng cc thit b khi s dng thit b chuyn i in p ny?",
    "",
    "12",
    "CHNG I  M U",
    "",
    "**Bng 2.1. Mt s k hiu trn cc thit b th nghim**",
    "",
    "| K hiu | M t | K hiu | M t |",
    "|---|---|---|---|",
    "| DC hoc du  | Dng in mt chiu | \"+\" hoc mu  | Cc dng |",
    "| AC hoc du ~ | Dng in xoay chiu | \"\" hoc mu xanh | Cc m |",
    "| Input (I) | u vo | [K hiu hai mi tn ch ln] | Dng c t ng |",
    "| Output | u ra | [K hiu mt tri b gch cho] | Trnh nh nng chiu trc tip |",
    "| [K hiu hnh thoi mu ] | Bnh kh nn p sut cao | [K hiu li thu tinh] | Dng c d v |",
    "| [K hiu cnh bo tia laser] | Cnh bo tia laser | [K hiu thng rc b gch cho] | Khng c php b vo thng rc |",
    "| [K hiu cnh bo nhit  cao] | Nhit  cao | [K hiu du chm than] | Lu  cn thn |",
    "| [K hiu nam chm] | T trng | | |",
    "",
    "**2. S dng cc thit b nhit v thu tinh**",
    "Cc thit b un nng c th gy bng vi ngi s dng, gy nt, v cc b phn lm bng thu tinh.",
    "",
    "**Hot ng:** Quan st thit b th nghim v nhit hc  Hnh 2.2 v cho bit: c im ca cc dng c th nghim trong khi tin hnh th nghim  m bo an ton cn ch  n iu g?",
    "[Hnh 2.2. Th nghim o nhit  si ca nc. Hnh nh cho thy Nhit k, Bnh thu tinh chu nhit, n cn]",
    "",
    "**3. S dng cc thit b quang hc**",
    "Cc thit b quang hc rt d mc, xc, nt, v v dnh bi bn, lm nh hng n ng truyn tia sng v sai lch kt qu th nghim.",
    "",
    "**Hot ng:** Quan st thit b th nghim quang hnh (Hnh 2.3) v cho bit: c im ca cc dng c th nghim khi s dng v bo qun thit b cn ch  n iu g?",
    "[Hnh 2.3. B th nghim quang hnh. Hnh nh cho thy n, Thu knh, Mn nh, Gng phng]",
    "",
    "13",
    "CHNG I  M U",
    "",
    "## II. NGUY C MT AN TON TRONG S DNG THIT B TH NGHIM VT L",
    "**1. Nguy c gy nguy him cho ngi s dng**",
    "Vic thc hin sai thao tc s dng cc thit b c th dn n nguy him cho ngi s dng. V vy, khi tin hnh th nghim cn tun th nghim ngt cc quy nh trong phng thc hnh v hng dn ca gio vin.",
    "",
    "**Hot ng:** Em hy quan st mt s hnh nh v thao tc s dng cc thit b th nghim trong Hnh 2.4 v d on xem c nhng nguy c no c th gy nguy him trong phng thc hnh vt l.",
    "K thm nhng thao tc s dng thit b th nghim khc c th gy nguy him trong phng thc hnh.",
    "[Hnh 2.4a: Cm phch in vo  (tay cm khng ng cch)]",
    "[Hnh 2.4b: Rt phch in (cm vo dy thay v phch)]",
    "[Hnh 2.4c: Dy in b sn]",
    "[Hnh 2.4d: Chiu tia laser (chiu vo mt)]",
    "[Hnh 2.4e: un nc trn n cn (khng cn thn)]",
    "*Hnh 2.4. Mt s thao tc c th gy mt an ton khi s dng thit b th nghim*",
    "",
    "**2. Nguy c hng thit b o in**",
    "Khi s dng cc thit b o in cn chn ng thang o, khng nhm ln khi thao tc  m bo an ton cho thit b o.",
    "",
    "**? Cu hi:**",
    "1. Gii hn o ca ampe k  Hnh 2.5 l bao nhiu?",
    "2. Nu s dng ampe k  o dng in vt qu gii hn o th c th gy ra nguy c g?",
    "",
    "Khi s dng ng h o in a nng (thit b o in vi cc chc nng chnh l o in tr, o hiu in th v o dng in AC, DC), cn lu :",
    " Chn chc nng v thang o ph hp.",
    " Cm dy o vo cht cm ph hp vi chc nng o.",
    "",
    "[Hnh 2.5: Ampe k kim, c gii hn o 3A, ang cm  cht 3A]",
    "*Hnh 2.5. Ampe k*",
    "",
    "14",
    "CHNG I  M U",
    "",
    "[Hnh 2.6a: ng h o in a nng kim khung quay]",
    "[Hnh 2.6b: ng h o in a nng hin s]",
    "*Hnh 2.6. ng h o in a nng kim khung quay a) v ng h o in a nng hin s b)*",
    "",
    "**? Cu hi:**",
    "iu chnh v tr ca kim o, chn thang o v cm cc dy o trn ng h a nng (Hnh 2.6)  o hiu in th, cng  dng in v in tr nh th no?",
    "",
    "**3. Nguy c chy n trong phng thc hnh**",
    "Khi tin hnh th nghim vi cc thit b in v nhng ho cht, cht d chy n trong phng thc hnh cn tun th quy tc an ton, nht l nhng quy tc an ton v phng chy cha chy v an ton khi s dng ho cht d chy, n.",
    "",
    "**Hot ng:** Em hy quan st mt s hnh nh v cc th nghim trong Hnh 2.7 v d on c nhng nguy c chy n no c th xy ra trong phng thc hnh.",
    "[Hnh 2.7a:  cc kp in gn nhau]",
    "[Hnh 2.7b:  cht d chy gn th nghim mch in]",
    "[Hnh 2.7c: Khng eo gng tay cao su chu nhit khi lm th nghim vi nhit  cao]",
    "*Hnh 2.7. Mt s tnh hung thc hin th nghim trong phng thc hnh*",
    "",
    "**! Ch :** Khi phng thc hnh c m chy, cn ngt in, t chc thot nn, cu ngi, cu ti sn, chng chy lan, dp tt m chy.",
    "Mt s lu :",
    " Ngt ton b h thng in.",
    " a ton b cc ho cht, cc cht d chy ra khu vc an ton.",
    " Khng c s dng nc dp m chy ni c cc thit b in, m chy hydrocacbon hoc cc cht lng c t trng nh hn nc nh du, cn,...",
    " Khng c s dng CO$_2$  dp tt m chy qun o trn ngi hoc chy kim loi kim nh magnesium, cc cht chy c kh nng tch oxygen nh peroxide, chlorate, potassium nitrate,...",
    "",
    "15",
    "CHNG I  M U",
    "",
    "## III. QUY TC AN TON TRONG PHNG THC HNH",
    " c k hng dn s dng thit b v quan st cc ch dn, cc k hiu trn cc thit b th nghim.",
    " Kim tra cn thn thit b, phng tin, dng c th nghim trc khi s dng.",
    " Ch tin hnh th nghim khi c s cho php ca gio vin hng dn th nghim.",
    " Tt cng tc ngun thit b in trc khi cm hoc tho thit b in.",
    " Ch cm phch / gic cm ca thit b in vo  cm khi hiu in th ca ngun in tng ng vi hiu in th nh mc ca dng c.",
    " Phi b tr dy in gn gng, khng b vng khi qua li.",
    " Khng tip xc trc tip vi cc vt v cc thit b th nghim c nhit  cao khi khng c dng c bo h.",
    " Khng  nc cng nh cc dung dch dn in, dung dch d chy gn thit b in.",
    " Gi khong cch an ton khi tin hnh th nghim nung nng cc vt, th nghim c cc vt bn ra, tia laser.",
    " Phi v sinh, sp xp gn gng cc thit b v dng c th nghim, b cht thi th nghim vo ng ni quy nh sau khi tin hnh th nghim.",
    "",
    "[Hnh 2.8. Cc bin bo trong phng th nghim]",
    "[Bin bo Cht c sc kho]",
    "[Bin bo Cht c mi trng]",
    "[Bin bo Ni nguy him v in]",
    "[Bin bo Li thot him]",
    "[Bin bo Cht d chy]",
    "[Bin bo Cht n mn]",
    "[Bin bo Ni cm la]",
    "[Bin bo Ni c cht phng x]",
    "",
    "**! Ch :** Khi pht hin ngi b in git cn nhanh chng ngt ngun in hoc s dng vt cch in  tch ngi b nn ra khi ngun in.",
    "",
    "**EM  HC**",
    "-  m bo an ton khi s dng thit b trong phng thc hnh, cn c k hng dn v cc k hiu trn thit b.",
    "- Thc hin nghim tc cc quy nh v an ton trong phng thc hnh.",
    "",
    "**EM C TH**",
    "Gii thch c v sao:",
    "1. Khi s dng thit b o in, phi lun t  thang o ph hp.",
    "2. Khi s dng my bin p phi t nt iu chnh in p  mc thp nht ri tng dn ln.",
    "",
    "**EM C BIT?**",
    "1. Sc in (hay in git): Sc in xy ra khi dng in chy qua ngi, c th gy ra tn thng cc b phn ca c th hoc t vong.",
