    "| $\\cos\\alpha$ | 1 | $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ | $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ | 0 | $-1$ |",
    "| $\\tan\\alpha$ | 0 | $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$ | 1 | $\\sqrt{3}$ | $||$ | 0 |",
    "| $\\cot\\alpha$ | $||$ | $\\sqrt{3}$ | 1 | $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$ | 0 | $||$ |",
