    "",
    "| $x$ | $-\\pi$ | $-\\frac{3\\pi}{4}$ | $-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ | $-\\frac{\\pi}{4}$ | $0$ | $\\frac{\\pi}{4}$ | $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ | $\\frac{3\\pi}{4}$ | $\\pi$ |",
