    "Ta có: $\\lim_{x \\to +\\infty} f(x) = \\lim_{x \\to +\\infty} \\frac{3x - 2}{x + 1} = \\lim_{x \\to +\\infty} \\frac{3 - \\frac{2}{x}}{1 + \\frac{1}{x}} = 3$. Tương tự, $\\lim_{x \\to -\\infty} f(x) = 3$.",
