    "$$[\\vec{u}, \\vec{v}] = \\left( \\begin{vmatrix} b & c \\\\ b' & c' \\end{vmatrix}; \\ \\begin{vmatrix} c & a \\\\ c' & a' \\end{vmatrix}; \\ \\begin{vmatrix} a & b \\\\ a' & b' \\end{vmatrix} \\right).$$",
    "",
    "30",
